   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">17 November 2020, Beletweyne District, Somalia - Iraado Amir Omar, 36 years old, works on her farm at Dharkeenley village, Beletweyne district, Somalia on 17th November 2020. FAO Somalia offers livelihood assistance to local Somali farmers and agro-pastoralists affected by Desert Locust upsurge by providing cash, quality seeds, farming tools and training.</rdf:li>
